{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CftGY9RgkxtKXC7MPF8Gj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I wrote four PlantUML views and a README to `task2view-out/IS-seat-L2/`. I haven't rendered the `.puml` files, so none has been checked for syntax errors.\n\n- **`view-1.puml` (components):** the components behind seat booking and what each is responsible for. Requests go from the Swing UI or the REST `ReservationController` into `LibraryFacade`, then `ReservationManager`, which holds the booking rules. From there they reach the entities and registries, then `PersistenceManager`. `NotificationManager` is notified when a reservation changes.\n- **`view-2.puml` (`makeReservation` sequence):** the order of checks and where each current rule lives:\n  - the room is active and open on the date;\n  - the time slot has not started or passed;\n  - the student has no other active or confirmed reservation for that date and slot;\n  - the seat is available;\n  - the seat is either the one the student chose or picked automatically by `FirstAvailableAssignment`.\n\n  It ends with the save and the notification. This is where new rules would most likely go.\n- **`view-3.puml` (reservation states):** the lifecycle (Active, Confirmed, Cancelled, Expired, Completed) and its time rules. Cancellation must be at least 6 hours before the slot, and check-in must be within 10 minutes of its start. Active and Confirmed reservations are the ones that block a seat.\n- **`view-4.puml` (impact map):** which parts may be affected by a rule change, colour-coded by how likely they are to need edits. This view is my judgement from the code dependencies, not something the code states directly.\n\nThe README explains what each view shows and why.\n\nSeveral of the code comments in the repository are placeholders (\"English implementation note\"), so I based the views on the code itself."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4602,"cache_read_input_tokens":60606,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4602},"output_tokens":577,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8029d137-1b9c-4d38-af2e-2dc09b578b50","uuid":"100dfb89-bc37-487a-a6cd-85c4b13ea099","timestamp":"2026-10-10T08:49:33.293Z","request_id":"req_011CftGY956zAA2gedf5VGsF"}
